y's partial-similarity proposal covers this case.\n\nI'm working through the payoff comparison for cooperating versus defecting, where cooperation wins once ρ is high enough relative to the chance the other copy also cooperates. Since the decision structure is identical and the name difference seems irrelevant, I'd put ρ high, which points toward passing.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether the other copy's decision depends on my function's output under A-FDT, since it runs on different inputs. The two calls are strictly different nodes, but the difference looks symmetric and irrelevant, so I'm checking whether the essay's partial-similarity proposal covers this case.\n\nI'm working through the payoff comparison for cooperating versus defecting, where cooperation wins once ρ is high enough relative to the chance the other copy also cooperates. Since the decision structure is identical and the name difference seems irrelevant, I'd put ρ high, which points toward passing.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9944,"completion_tokens":982,"total_tokens":10926,"cost":0.059416,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.059416,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.039776,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01964},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":521,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}